The '''Sengoku period''' refers to the almost simultaneous conflicts that happened in the Sanese Archipelago:

* '''[[Sengoku period (Okaiken)]]''', a period of civil war in [[Okaiken]] from 1467 to 1625.
* '''[[Sengoku period (Nakamizu)]]''', a brief period of civil war in [[Nakamizu]] from 1545 to 1632.